I think this is a classic problem.

There are quite a few ways to do this.

1. Read a scroll of remove curse
2. Take off other armor and read a scroll of destroy armor
3. Use a blank scroll and a magic marker to do 1 or 2.
4. #dip them in holy water
5. pray
6. find a nymph and let her steal them

If you don't have any of the equipment required for the above,
and your god is angry with you, and you genocided nymphs, there 
is (I think) only one way to do it:

7. Find a sink and float over it.

If you can't find a sink before you starve, then you're out of luck.
